{"name":"Head in the Clouds","hex":"#d1dde1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"head in the clouds","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Phrase","definitions":["Used to indicate that a person is distracted or disconnected from the present situation or reality in general.","Used to indicate that a person has fantastic or impractical dreams."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/head_in_the_clouds"}],"entries":[{"title":"Head in the Clouds (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Head in the Clouds is a 2004 Canadian-British war drama film written and directed by John Duigan. The original screenplay focuses on the choices young lovers must make as they find themselves surrounded by increasing political unrest in late-1930s Europe. The film was a critical and box office failure."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/19/HeadInTheCloudsPoster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Head_in_the_Clouds_(film)","wikidata":"Q653336"},{"title":"Head in the Clouds (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Head in the Clouds is a compilation album by musical collective 88rising. It was released through 88rising and 12Tone Music on July 20, 2018. Guest appearances include Yung Bans, Yung Pinch, 03 Greedo, BlocBoy JB, Vory, Phum Viphurit, Playboi Carti, Famous Dex, Verbal, GoldLink and Harikiri."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/52/HeadInTheClouds-Album.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Head_in_the_Clouds_(album)","wikidata":"Q60741253"},{"title":"Head","blocks":[{"text":"A head is the part of an organism which usually includes the ears, brain, forehead, cheeks, chin, eyes, nose, and mouth, each of which aids in various sensory functions such as sight, hearing, smell, and taste. Some very simple animals may not have a head, but many bilaterally symmetric forms do, regardless of size."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Portrait_of_a_Meerkat.jpg/330px-Portrait_of_a_Meerkat.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Head","wikidata":"Q23640"},{"title":"Cloud","blocks":[{"text":"In meteorology, a cloud is an aerosol consisting of a visible mass of miniature liquid droplets, ice crystals, or other particles, suspended in the atmosphere of a planetary body or similar space. Water, primarily, comprises the droplets and crystals. On Earth, clouds are formed as a result of saturation of the air when it is cooled to its dew point, or when it gains sufficient moisture, usually in the form of water vapor, from an adjacent source to raise the dew point to the ambient temperature."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/ISS-40_Thunderheads_near_Borneo.jpg/330px-ISS-40_Thunderheads_near_Borneo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cloud","wikidata":"Q8074"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Beethovendeathmask.jpg/330px-Beethovendeathmask.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Beethovendeathmask.jpg/330px-Beethovendeathmask.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The head of a death mask","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABeethovendeathmask.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/View_of_a_Skull_III.jpg/120px-View_of_a_Skull_III.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/View_of_a_Skull_III.jpg/250px-View_of_a_Skull_III.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/com